  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/7751840ca1840d12cadc428f84d30e2cdcd5e7f82d52a57de21f2404c58eed88.png] \n\nGiven equation: 28 ÷ 4 - 12 × 5 + 11 = 56\n\nOption 1) ÷ and -\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get:\n\n⇒ 28 - __**4 **____**÷**____** 12 × 5**__ + 11 = 56\n\n⇒ __**28**__ - 1.67 __**+ 11**__ = 56\n\n⇒ __3**9**** - 1.67**__ = 56\n\n⇒ 38.67 = 56\n\nOption 2) × and +\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get:\n\n⇒ __**28 ÷ 4**__ - 12 + 5 × 11 = 56\n\n⇒ 7 - 12 + __**5 × 11**__ = 56\n\n⇒ __**7**__ - 12 __**+ 55**__ = 56\n\n⇒ __**62 - 12**__ = 56\n\n⇒ 50 = 56\n\nOption 3) × and ÷\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get:\n\n⇒ 28 × 4 - __**12 ÷ 5**__ + 11 = 56\n\n⇒ __**28 × 4**__ - 2.4 + 11 = 56\n\n⇒ __112__ - 2.4 __**+ 11**__ = 56\n\n⇒ __123__**__ - 2.4__** = 56\n\n⇒ 120.6 = 56\n\n**Option 4) + and -**\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get:\n\n⇒ __**28 ÷ 4**__ + 12 × 5 - 11 = 56\n\n⇒ 7 + __**12 × 5**__ - 11 = 56\n\n⇒ __**7 + **____60__ - 11 = 56\n\n⇒ __67____** - 11**__ = 56\n\n**⇒ 56 = 56**\n\nHence, the correct answer is** \"+ and -\".**",
